# Proposed by the swarm's review (2026-10-14); the documenter may edit or drop it.
# Story: four windows in a grid. One is walked to the right with ⌃⌥⌘→ until it
# cannot go further. It is in view and has the keyboard at every step, and the camera
# never moves.
# Reference: T02 T16.
open Safari
open Notes
open Mail
open Music
arrange
expect count docked 4
focus 101
dock right
expect ok
expect visible 101
expect camera root
dock right
expect visible 101
dock right
# Next to the narrow Desktop column it gets a fair share of the row, not half of the Desktop.
expect visible 101
expect camera root
dock right
expect visible 101
dock right
expect fail
# And back again.
dock left
expect visible 101
dock left
expect visible 101
dock left
expect visible 101
expect camera root
